WS-IDDC-PREV     W  2 A                                                         
WS-OMR-PREV      W  2 N   VALUE 0                                               
WS-SUM-OMR       W  2  P                                                        
WS-SUM-OMR-TOT   W  2  P                                                        
WS-SUM-ANT       W  3  P 0                                                      
WS-SUM-ANT-TOT   W  3  P 0                                                      
WS-SUM-STD       W  7  P 2                                                      
WS-SUM-STD-TOT   W  7  P 2                                                      
                                                                                
W-IDDC           W  2  N 0 MASK 'Z9'                                            
W-SUM-OMR        W  2  N 0 MASK 'Z9'                                            
W-SUM-OMR-TOT    W  2  N 0 MASK 'Z9'                                            
W-SUM-ANT        W  5  N 0 MASK 'ZZZZ9'                                         
W-SUM-ANT-TOT    W  5  N 0 MASK 'ZZZZ9'                                         
