*--------------------------------------------------                             
*  RAPPORT06 FIL TILL ONDEMAND PER SDC                                          
*--------------------------------------------------                             
                                                                                
REPORT   RAPPORT06                                 +                            
         PRINTER W51393DE                          +                            
         LINESIZE 120  SUMMARY NOADJUST NOPAGE NODATE                           
SEQUENCE O-IDDC SUM-OMR SUM-OMR-TOT                                             
CONTROL  FINAL NOPRINT O-IDDC  NEWPAGE SUM-OMR                                  
TITLE 1 COL   1 'W51393-0'                              +                       
        COL   9 TP-IDDC                                 +                       
        COL  20 'VCCS'                                  +                       
        COL  40 'LIST OF SELECTIONREGISTER SDC       '  +                       
        COL  90 'DC: '                                  +                       
        COL  94 O-IDDC                                  +                       
        COL 100 'DATE: '                                +                       
        COL 106 W-DATUM                                                         
TITLE 2 '  '                                                                    
TITLE 4 'REMAINS                            TOTAL STOCK VALUE '                 
HEADING SUM-OMR            ('AREA')                                             
HEADING SUM-ANT            ('     QTY')                                         
HEADING SUM-STD            ('           SUM. STD')                              
